{
    "title": "Little Panda's Town: Street",
    "description": "Come to Town: Street and create nice memories! Shop at the supermarket with your friends, cook food, take care of babies, and have a relaxing time! You can play all day long on the town street!\r\n\r\nSHOP AT THE SUPERMARKET\r\nFirst of all, let's go shopping at the new supermarket in town! From fruits, vegetables, and fresh food to drinks and desserts, the supermarket has just about everything you could wish for! Pick your favorite items, add them to your cart, and pay for them!\r\n\r\nCOOK FOOD\r\nThen return to your apartment and hold a food party by preparing a big dinner with the ingredients you bought from the supermarket! Cook delicious burgers, bake fruit cakes, and more! Then, invite your friends and share with them!\r\n\r\nTAKE CARE OF BABIES\r\nAfter the party, let's go to the cozy nursery! Shh! Keep your voice down in here! The babies are napping! After they wake up from their nap, play music instruments together!\r\n\r\nMEET ANIMALS\r\nNow let's go for a walk in Mermaid Park! Here, you will meet many little animals, such as kittens and puppies! Adopt a cute puppy, feed it, play with it, dress it up, and take it home!\r\n\r\nThere are more surprises in Little Panda's Town: Street for you to discover!\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n- Explore an open world the way you like and create your own street story;\r\n- Discover new worlds from 6 scenes;\r\n- Realistic simulation to restore an ideal street life;\r\n- Hundreds of items and rich interaction for you to explore;\r\n- 37 cute characters to play with you all day long!\r\n\r\nAbout BabyBus\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\r\nAt BabyBus, we dedicate ourselves to sparking kids' creativity, imagination and curiosity,and designing our products through the kids' perspective to help them explore the world on their own.\r\n\r\nNow BabyBus offers a wide variety of products, videos and other educational content for over 600 million fans from ages 0-8 around the world! We have released over 200 children's apps, over 2500 episodes of nursery rhymes and animations, over 9000 stories  of various themes spanning the Health, Language, Society, Science, Art and other fields.\r\n\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\r\nContact us: ser@babybus.com\r\nVisit us: http://www.babybus.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Come to Town: Street and create nice memories! Shop at the supermarket with your friends, cook food, take care of babies, and have a relaxing time! You can play all day long on the town street!<br><br>SHOP AT THE SUPERMARKET<br>First of all, let&#39;s go shopping at the new supermarket in town! From fruits, vegetables, and fresh food to drinks and desserts, the supermarket has just about everything you could wish for! Pick your favorite items, add them to your cart, and pay for them!<br><br>COOK FOOD<br>Then return to your apartment and hold a food party by preparing a big dinner with the ingredients you bought from the supermarket! Cook delicious burgers, bake fruit cakes, and more! Then, invite your friends and share with them!<br><br>TAKE CARE OF BABIES<br>After the party, let&#39;s go to the cozy nursery! Shh! Keep your voice down in here! The babies are napping! After they wake up from their nap, play music instruments together!<br><br>MEET ANIMALS<br>Now let&#39;s go for a walk in Mermaid Park! Here, you will meet many little animals, such as kittens and puppies! Adopt a cute puppy, feed it, play with it, dress it up, and take it home!<br><br>There are more surprises in Little Panda&#39;s Town: Street for you to discover!<br><br>FEATURES:<br>- Explore an open world the way you like and create your own street story;<br>- Discover new worlds from 6 scenes;<br>- Realistic simulation to restore an ideal street life;<br>- Hundreds of items and rich interaction for you to explore;<br>- 37 cute characters to play with you all day long!<br><br>About BabyBus<br>\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014<br>At BabyBus, we dedicate ourselves to sparking kids&#39; creativity, imagination and curiosity,and designing our products through the kids&#39; perspective to help them explore the world on their own.<br><br>Now BabyBus offers a wide variety of products, videos and other educational content for over 600 million fans from ages 0-8 around the world! We have 